@UNReliefChief will allocate up to $140M from @UNCERF to support a series of 𝐚𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐜𝐢𝐩𝐚𝐭𝐨𝐫𝐲-𝐚𝐜𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 interventions over the next 18 months, starting with $15M in Somalia.
